 <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic mb-6">7. Comprehensive QC Inspection Checklist</h2>
 <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">A thorough inspection covers multiple aspects of the charger. Here's what your QC process should include:</p>

 <div class="space-y-6">
 <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 border border-slate-200">
